  {
   "n": 2,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "numerical | Marks +1",
   "html": "<p>Consider the below ROM:</p>\n<p><img src=\"media/3a/3a26b439444e2f3dd495.png\"></p>\n<p>Total number of fuses required to fabricate all &lsquo;OR&rsquo; gates in the above diagram is ______ .<br>Note: Presence of &lsquo;&times;&rsquo; indicates fuse is retained, otherwise fuse is blown.</p>",
   "options": [],
   "answer": null,
   "natRange": [
    48,
    48
   ],
   "answerText": "48",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0
   },
   "solution": "<p>In the given diagram, OR gates are programmable i.e. each OR gate requires 16 fuses.<br>Hence total number of fuses required is 16 &times; 3 = 48.</p>"
  },
